        "id": 1106949
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-08-08T16:41:05Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e  The EC only sends one or the other,\n\nIt\u0027s not clear to me how that\u0027s guaranteed. Maybe you can explain how back-to-back events coming from external sources are processed. Nobody except the host seems to be clearing cec_events in common/cec.c.",
      "parentUuid": "28c1a26e_cec2a52d",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 11326,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 11329,
        "endChar": 3
      },
      "revId": "96e9423f40cd6332187e7c0a734f143814e570c4",
